  "body_text": "上一版发布里面有两个豆子的产国错了，更正下，顺便把产季信息加上，未标产季年份的均为2022产季！\n强烈推荐瑰夏组合，很划算！",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           上一版发布里面有两个豆子的产国错了，更正下，顺便把产季信息加上，未标产季年份的均为2022产季！\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          强烈推荐瑰夏组合，很划算！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJSR625zyJN7ibLoeicObudTdRcNrHP1OUnFhO086ypyMWWV54tEvfQz7Y6Me4iaiahMmHfjhgO7w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtpkWc5VzQCR97iaTR65nIPXs6IMSia70FlfmpbEOMp9IwOtKXC9Cm7CJ5hMagZfeghsS1lroiaYZHw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJSR625zyJN7ibLoeicOb5N0Jdkibz0pCKURrhujraSiaKt3uicphWoZA6kwuJQLXbFyKYd2gheUww/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJSR625zyJN7ibLoeicObYOaeBicd8YpiastficxCQ1j75ekibUXely5JmLOqXsby6zibjotujAzjfXw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJSR625zyJN7ibLoeicObuq6icTRxh8U2En8hzFVTph1T9ljNKD1UfApEuYBoHglMXqpTXKACjUw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJSR625zyJN7ibLoeicObUCTULhl1Jy4zXZcTq4cjYgl0bPMuKTX9aibcJfQsdvfAzc85eYC9s2g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJSR625zyJN7ibLoeicObDTtjJyxuvibrXD3MMuvNg5N2mdvfmViaiazvXAoJWsR52FXtpoGQ0X5Nw/640?wx_fmt=png\">\n</img>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5zQJS